                                                                                
 Usage: opentide [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                                    
                                                                                
 Spec-driven development for agentic detection engineering                      
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --repo                        <str>  Repository root                         │
│                                      [env var: OPENTIDE_REPO_ROOT]           │
│ --data                        <str>  Bundled data root                       │
│                                      [env var: OPENTIDE_DATA_ROOT]           │
│ --debug                              Enable debug logging. Also              │
│                                      OPENTIDE_DEBUG=1                        │
│ --quiet                              Print only the outcome line and errors  │
│ --verbose                            Also print notes, such as a missing     │
│                                      optional field. --json always includes  │
│                                      them                                    │
│ --no-color                           Disable colour                          │
│ --json                               Machine-readable output: one JSON       │
│                                      object on stdout                        │
│ --proxy                       <str>  HTTP(S) proxy URL                       │
│                                      (http://[user:pass@]host:port) for      │
│                                      platform and lookup calls. Overrides    │
│                                      HTTP_PROXY and HTTPS_PROXY; hosts in    │
│                                      NO_PROXY are still reached directly.    │
│                                      [env var: OPENTIDE_PROXY]               │
│ --version             -V             Print the installed opentide version    │
│                                      and exit                                │
│ --install-completion                 Install completion; name a shell after  │
│                                      it to pick one                          │
│ --show-completion                    Print the script instead; name a shell  │
│                                      after it to pick one                    │
│ --help                               Show this message and exit.             │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Author ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ validate  Validate objects and queries                                       │
│ query     Run a read-only query on platform tenants and show rows            │
│ lint      Check file names and recommended metadata                          │
│ info      Show repository and platform information                           │
│ new       Scaffold a threat, objective or rule from its template             │
│ generate  Generate schemas, templates, docs and exports                      │
│ rules     Detection rule maintenance                                         │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Ship ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ deploy    Deploy rules to platform tenants                                   │
│ share     Publish objects to intelligence platforms                          │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Workspace ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ setup     Set up a detection repository and its tooling                      │
│ doctor    Check the installation, the workspace and its integrations         │
│ migrate   Rewrite objects for a newer opentide model                         │
│ tui       Browse the catalogue and its diagnostics in a terminal UI          │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Agents and integrations ────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ explain   Explain a diagnostic code and how to fix it                        │
│ commands  List every command and option, for agents                          │
│ mcp       Run the opentide MCP server for editors and agents                 │
│ lsp       Serve the language server for editors                              │
│ serve     Run CLI commands in one warm process, for editors                  │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide setup
   $ opentide validate
   $ opentide --json validate
